# Stack

- Rust desktop app. Dioxus 0.7, Tailwind, and a small Rust/UI-style component set.
- MapLibre through `dioxus-maplibre`. Ship library files and a local style in `assets/`. Do not load map tiles or scripts from a CDN.
- Radio access through `meshcore-rs` on one pool: BLE, USB serial, and TCP (Wi-Fi / Ethernet companions, default port 5000).
- SQLite in WAL mode under `data/`, which is gitignored. One database for every radio.
- Channel secrets go in the OS keyring. If that fails, use a `0600` file under `data/` and show that in Settings.
- No Docker. `dx serve --platform desktop` runs the window on this laptop and the LattePanda.
- Desktop is the default Cargo feature so Windows, macOS, and Linux share one program.
- Linux baseline is Ubuntu 26.04+ (CI `ubuntu-26.04`). Runtime GTK package is `libgtk-3-0t64`, not `libgtk-3-0`.
